lore_blurb = "Second iteration. Our engineers attempted to replicate the Prototype's self-configuring architecture using conventional substrate. The result was not what they built.\n\nThe Mk.II uses the operator's own neural pattern as its encryption key. This was not a design decision. It was discovered three days after first activation when the device's output signal became uniquely keyed to the researcher conducting the test. When that researcher was rotated off the project, the device went dormant. When she returned — six weeks later, to a different lab — it reactivated.\n\nFull research of this item is flagged for AI Overseer review. Reason: unknown."
